### 1. 预请求：获取 CSRF Cookie
GET {{host}}/login.html

> {%
    let cookies = response.headers.valuesOf("Set-Cookie");
    for (let cookie of cookies) {
        if (cookie.indexOf("csrf-token=") !== -1) {
            let match = cookie.match(/csrf-token=([^;]+)/);
            if (match) {
                client.global.set("csrf_token", match[1]);
            }
        }
    }
%}

### 2. 标准 Form 表单登录并勾选“记住我” (rme=on)
POST {{host}}/your-login-path
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=admin&rme=on&_csrf={{csrf_token}}

### 3. 使用登录会话或 Remember-Me Cookie 访问受保护接口
GET {{host}}/admin
Accept: text/plain

### 4. 退出登录 (调用系统默认与自定义 LogoutHandler)
POST {{host}}/logout
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

_csrf={{csrf_token}}

### 5. 退出登录后再次访问 /admin (预期重定向至登录页 302)
GET {{host}}/admin
Accept: text/html
